{
  "id": "Lyo.Api.Export",
  "name": "Lyo.Api.Export",
  "area": "Integration",
  "tagline": "Optional export feature for Lyo.Api. Registers the **Export** CRUD endpoint and `IExportService<TContext>`.",
  "description": "Optional export feature for [Lyo.Api](../Lyo.Api/README.md). Registers the **Export** CRUD endpoint and `IExportService<TContext>`.",
  "features": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "title": "Setup",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": "builder.Services.AddLyoCrudServices<MyDbContext>();\nbuilder.Services.AddLyoApiExport<MyDbContext>();\nbuilder.Services.AddCsvExport(); // Lyo.Api.Export.Csv\nbuilder.Services.AddXlsxExport(); // Lyo.Api.Export.Xlsx"
    },
    {
      "title": "Setup (2)",
      "language": "csharp",
      "code": ".WithCrud(ApiFeatureSet.DefaultCrud + ExportApiFeature.Instance, config)\n// or\n.WithCrud(crud => crud.WithFlags(ApiFeatureSet.DefaultCrud + ExportApiFeature.Instance))"
    }
  ],
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "title": "Setup",
      "text": "Enable export on endpoint builders with `ExportApiFeature.Instance`: JSON export is built into `Lyo.Api` via `AddBuiltInExportFormatHandlers()` (called from `AddLyoCrudServices`). CSV and XLSX require the respective format addon packages."
    }
  ],
